# NEXUS — Day 1 Engineering Log

## Objective

Define the product vision, engineering principles, system boundaries, and long-term architecture for NEXUS.

## Product Vision

NEXUS is an AI-powered productivity operating system designed to understand the relationship between goals, projects, tasks, time, context, and user behavior.

The system is designed to move beyond conventional task management.

Instead of simply answering:

> What tasks do I have?

NEXUS aims to eventually answer:

> What should I work on next, and why?

## Core Principles

1. Context over isolated tasks
2. Deterministic foundations before AI
3. Explainable recommendations
4. Privacy-aware architecture
5. Modular engineering
6. Production-oriented development
7. Extensible intelligence layer

## Initial Domain

```text
User
 ↓
Goal
 ↓
Project
 ↓
Task
 ↓
Subtask

